<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI 활용 HTML/CSS 프레젠테이션 보고</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pretendard:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        /* 기본 스타일 초기화 및 프레젠테이션 최적화 */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body, html {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: #0b0f19;
            font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            color: #1e293b;
        }

        .presentation-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
        }

        /* 개별 슬라이드 전환 시스템 (오른쪽에서 등장하는 모션) */
        .slide {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transition: opacity 0.6s ease-in-out, transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
            transform: translateX(50px);
            background-color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            padding: 60px 100px;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* 활성화된 슬라이드 */
        .slide.active {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
            transform: translateX(0);
            z-index: 2;
        }

        /* 인트로 & 아웃트로 테마 */
        .slide.theme-dark {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e3a8a 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* 배경 데코레이션 링 */
        .decor-circle {
            position: absolute;
            width: 500px;
            height: 500px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08) 0%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05) 100%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: -100px;
            right: -100px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .decor-circle-bottom {
            position: absolute;
            width: 300px;
            height: 300px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.04) 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.06) 100%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            bottom: -50px;
            left: -50px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* 상단 슬라이드 헤더 */
        .slide-header {
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .slide-tag {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2563eb;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: block;
        }

        .slide-title {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .slide-title span {
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        /* [페이지 0] 인트로 폰트 */
        .intro-content h1 {
            font-size: 64px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.3;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffffff, #93c5fd);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .intro-content p {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .meta-info {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #64748b;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            padding-top: 20px;
        }

        /* [페이지 1] 개요 레이아웃 */
        .grid-2 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .concept-card {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-left: 5px solid #2563eb;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .concept-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }

        .concept-card h3 {
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #1e293b;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .concept-card h3 i { color: #2563eb; }

        .visual-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eff6ff 0%, #dbeafe 100%);
            border-radius: 20px;
            height: 280px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            border: 1px dashed #bfdbfe;
        }

        .visual-box i {
            font-size: 80px;
            color: #3b82f6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }

        /* [페이지 2] 장점 파트 - 카드 순차 상승 애니메이션 */
        .cards-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .advantage-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            transform: translateY(40px);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        /* 활성화 상태일 때 딜레이 주며 등장 */
        .slide.active .advantage-card:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0.1s; transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
        .slide.active .advantage-card:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 0.3s; transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
        .slide.active .advantage-card:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 0.5s; transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }

        .advantage-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px) !important;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .icon-circle {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 24px auto;
            font-size: 28px;
        }

        .advantage-card:nth-child(1) .icon-circle { background: #ecfdf5; color: #10b981; }
        .advantage-card:nth-child(2) .icon-circle { background: #eff6ff; color: #3b82f6; }
        .advantage-card:nth-child(3) .icon-circle { background: #f5f3ff; color: #8b5cf6; }

        /* [페이지 3] 활용 방안 로드맵 레이아웃 */
        .roadmap {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            position: relative;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .roadmap::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 40px;
            left: 50px;
            right: 50px;
            height: 4px;
            background: #e2e8f0;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .roadmap-step {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 15px;
        }

        .step-number {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 4px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 24px auto;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .slide.active .roadmap-step:nth-child(1) .step-number { border-color: #3b82f6; color: #3b82f6; background: #eff6ff; }
        .slide.active .roadmap-step:nth-child(2) .step-number { border-color: #2563eb; color: #2563eb; background: #dbeafe; }
        .slide.active .roadmap-step:nth-child(3) .step-number { border-color: #1d4ed8; color: #1d4ed8; background: #bfdbfe; }

        .roadmap-step h4 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0f172a; }
        .roadmap-step p { font-size: 15px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; }

        /* [페이지 4] 아웃트로 */
        .outro-content h2 { font-size: 80px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .outro-content p { font-size: 24px; color: #38bdf8; }

        /* 내비게이션 조작 바 */
        .controls {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 40px;
            right: 50px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            z-index: 10;
        }

        .control-btn {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
            border: none;
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #0f172a;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .control-btn:hover { background: #0f172a; color: #ffffff; }
        .slide.theme-dark ~ .controls .control-btn { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #ffffff; }
        .slide.theme-dark ~ .controls .control-btn:hover { background: #ffffff; color: #0f172a; }

        .progress-bar {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 0;
            left: 0;
            height: 5px;
            background: #2563eb;
            z-index: 10;
            transition: width 0.3s;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="presentation-container">
        
        <div class="slide theme-dark active" id="slide-0">
            <div class="intro-content">
                <h1>AI 기반 HTML/CSS<br>프레젠테이션 도입 제안</h1>
                <p>기획에서 웹 장표 자동 생성까지의 업무 효율화 전략</p>
                <div class="meta-info">부서 발표자용 마스터 덱</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="slide" id="slide-1">
            <div class="decor-circle"></div>
            <div class="slide-header">
                <span class="slide-tag">01. Overview</span>
                <h2 class="slide-title">문서 작성 패러다임의 <span>전환</span></h2>
            </div>
            
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class
